# Ignore Mac DS_Store files and other known temporary files
.DS_Store
docs/reports/*
releases/
*.tmp
*.swp
*.asv
*.m~
*.sqlite
__pycache__

# CORPUS RUN OUTPUT -- written into the repo root, never committed.
#
# `tests/+did2/+unittest/+helpers/writeCorpusReport.m` writes `corpus-reports/`
# and `tools/corpus_proven.py` writes `corpus-proven/`. Both are CI artifacts,
# uploaded by test-code.yml and test-corpus.yml; neither is source.
#
# `corpus-proven/` holds a REGENERATED COPY of DID-schema's
# V_eta_coverage_ledger.json (441 KB). Committing it here would put a second,
# unowned copy of another repository's generated artifact under version control
# in this one -- the drift this project has spent the day removing, installed
# fresh. Neither directory has ever been tracked (`git ls-files corpus-reports/`
# -> 0); this makes that deliberate rather than luck.
corpus-reports/
corpus-proven/
